              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 12, question 8; teacher page 75\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.8cm,y=-0.8cm]\n\\definecolor{houseGrid}{HTML}{CCCCCC}\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\path[use as bounding box] (0,0) rectangle (8,8);\n\\foreach \\v in {0,...,8}{\\draw[houseGrid,line width=0.25pt] (\\v,0)--(\\v,8);}\n\\foreach \\v in {0,...,8}{\\draw[houseGrid,line width=0.25pt] (0,\\v)--(8,\\v);}\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (1,5)--(3,5)--(3,3)--cycle;\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (1,7)--(7,7)--(7,1)--cycle;\n\\draw[black,dashed,line width=0.4pt] (1,4)--(1,7);\n\\draw[black,dashed,line width=0.4pt] (1,4)--(7,7);\n\\draw[black,dashed,line width=0.4pt] (1,4)--(7,1);\n\\fill[black] (1,4) circle (1.2pt);\n\\node[left,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] at (1,4) {$O$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
